<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Production Operators raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Production Operators raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co said analyst Byron Dunn raised his recommendation on Production Operators Corp to buy from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Production Operators shares were up 7/8 at 48-1/8 in late-morning trading on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
